cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "OMOP Report Template"
abstract: >
  A GitHub template repository for a study's manuscript-report repo: one
  study's Word report composition (which tables, which figures, the narrative),
  rendered from result artifacts only with no database connection, and
  consuming omopReportToolkit for the generic figure and table helpers. Kept
  separate from the analysis-core repository so the report can be shared and
  rebuilt independently.
  Funding: Research reported in this publication was supported by the National
  Center For Advancing Translational Sciences of the National Institutes of Health
  under Award Number K12TR005435. The content is solely the responsibility of the
  authors and does not necessarily represent the official views of the National
  Institutes of Health.
